ex` properties\r\n- [x] Local repro confirmed: before fix fetch has no method/body, after fix it does","created_at":"2026-03-31T18:02:05Z","updated_at":"2026-03-31T19:58:09Z","closed_at":"2026-03-31T19:54:12Z","merged_at":"2026-03-31T19:54:12Z","merge_commit_sha":"d0fe1ec216f8f322392e34ce40378d022e495cef","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":3559102393,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI5e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20integration","name":"pkg: integration","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to any renderer integration (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/16170/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/16170/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16170/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/statuses/0e38d0c4a6d283f9b0ad80d2fb25820512ccec08","head":{"label":"Crystora:fix/edge-middleware-method-body-16156","ref":"fix/edge-middleware-method-body-16156","sha":"0e38d0c4a6d283f9b0ad80d2fb25820512ccec08","user":{"login":"Crystora","id":218712309,"node_id":"U_kgDODQlI9Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218712309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystora","html_url":"https://github.com/Crystora","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystora/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystora/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystora/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystora/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystora/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystora/orgs","repos_url":"htt